Remove FDK AAC from airplay-audio (EchoMusicNext, 2026-11-18).

The Fraunhofer FDK AAC license is not GPL-compatible. The host streams ALAC
only, so the AAC encoder, its tests and the fdk-aac dependency are removed;
create_encoder now rejects AAC as an unsupported codec.

